{"n":55,"level":"A1","title":"Habits and routines (questions)","pt":"Hábitos e rotinas: perguntas","scene":"cafe","tod":"day","cast":["Naomi","Joe","Pog"],"fic":{"scene":"cafe","tod":"day","decor":[],"cast":[{"p":{"hs":"side","outfit":"shirt","top":"#ee7fa8","hair":"brown","skin":"deep","arms":"wave"}},{"p":{"hs":"side","outfit":"shirt","top":"#f2b84b","hair":"black","skin":"dark","arms":"point"}},{"p":{"hs":"spiky","outfit":"shirt","top":"#7b5cf0","hair":"blue","skin":"light","arms":"out"}}]},"minutes":64,"slides":[{"t":"cover","min":1,"title":"Habits and routines (questions)","pt":"Hábitos e rotinas: perguntas","level":"A1","n":55,"cast":["Naomi","Joe","Pog"]},{"t":"goals","min":1,"goal":"Fazer perguntas sobre hábitos com do/does.","canDo":["Usar do/does em perguntas","Responder com Yes, I do","Perguntar sobre quando e onde"]},{"t":"warm","min":2,"q":"Você costuma tomar café da manhã? Onde?","pt":"Eleve para perguntas com when/where.","chips":["What time do you get up?","Where do you have lunch?","Who do you train with?","Does he work on Sunday?"]},{"t":"curious","min":1,"title":"Entrevistas","text":"Em inglês, 'interview' pode ser uma conversa de emprego ou uma entrevista de jornal. Para entrevistar bem, faça perguntas abertas: 'What time do you get up?' e 'How do you relax?'.","kind":"Você sabia?"},{"t":"scene","min":1,"text":"Naomi entrevista Joe, o treinador, sobre a rotina dele para um blog do bairro.","line":"What time do you get up, Joe?","who":["Naomi","Joe","Pog"]},{"t":"article","min":2,"title":"A coach's day","text":"Joe is a basketball coach. He gets up at five thirty, has eggs and fruit for breakfast and runs five kilometers. At nine he goes to the school gym and prepares the practice. After lunch, he trains the kids until eight. At night he reads a book and goes to bed at ten. \"Do you ever get tired?\" asks Naomi, the journalist. \"Of course,\" says Joe, \"but I love my routine. It keeps me happy and healthy.\" Naomi writes it down for her blog.","p